<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2350_9001.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unßer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freindt</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachberlich</unclear> und guottwillige dienst
<lb n="2"/>zuvor. Fuersichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erßamb</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weyße</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beßonders</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>liebe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freindt</unclear> und guotte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbern</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> hochen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unerherten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kaußß</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werth</unclear>,
<lb n="5"/>die liebe <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fruechten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khommen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beßer</unclear> kain <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auff</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hoern</unclear>, sonder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allain</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ansehen</unclear> nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laider</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tag</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tagen</unclear> noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weitter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">staigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mueßßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wirdt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">F</unclear>.
<lb n="8"/>E. und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. zweifels frey selbsten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekhandt</unclear> und
<lb n="9"/>wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewußt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear>.
<lb n="10"/>Wann aber an ihme <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbsten</unclear> billich, auch der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vernunfft</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">natuerlichen</unclear> rechten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">änlig</unclear>, daß ain landt, mit den
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jenigen</unclear> sachen darmit es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begabt</unclear>, den andern zuo
<lb n="13"/>hilff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khommen</unclear> thuen, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">feueren</unclear>, zuo-
<lb n="14"/>mahl <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernemmen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mueßßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> unßere burger-
<lb n="15"/>schafft <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> jahrs an schmalz und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unschlitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermanglen</unclear> wölle.
<lb n="17"/>So <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuochen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> hiemit freindt-
<lb n="18"/>lich nachberlich, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear> ihre burgere und korn-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuehrer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dahin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anweißen</unclear> und vermögen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dahe</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dieselbiges</unclear> gemainer unßere statt gegen den
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruechten</unclear> schmalz, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">käß</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unschlitt</unclear> zuofuehren,
<lb n="22"/>und den unßerigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">käufflich</unclear> widerfahren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>,
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weilen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euwern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgern</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kornkäuffern</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>auff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßrigen</unclear> korn und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wochen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">marckhen</unclear> biß-
<lb n="25"/>anhero nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">miglikhait</unclear> vor andern allen will,
<lb n="26"/>gemacht, und die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fruechten</unclear> volgen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2350_9002.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="27"/>maßen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> nochmahls <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesinnet</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ganz</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zweiflen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>.
<lb n="29"/>werden mit der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anbegehrten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuerkher</unclear> unß in gleichem
<lb n="30"/>an die handt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegehn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwiilligt</unclear> sein.
<lb n="31"/>Daß seindt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">neben</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eraischenden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billichait</unclear>, umb
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegewandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>:
<lb n="33"/>nachbarlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuerwidern</unclear> wir genaigt willig. Datum
<lb n="34"/><origDate when="1622" resp="#ner">den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">31</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">t</unclear>. Augusti. Anno 1622.</origDate>
<lb n="35"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-68" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister unnd Rath
<lb n="36"/>der statt Überling</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2350_9003.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2350_9004.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="37"/>Den fürsichtigen, ersamen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> weisen
<lb n="38"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister unnd Rath der statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">S</unclear>.
<lb n="39"/>Gallen</orgName>, unsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> lieben
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündten</unclear> und gueten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> nachbarn.
</p>
